OL,3,GEast                                   
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPartly       
OL,6,Fcloudy and widely dry this evening and 
OL,7,Fovernight, although very locally the   
OL,8,Fodd light shower is possible. Not as   
OL,9,Fcold as Friday night but a local frost 
OL,10,Fand isolated fog patches still likely  
OL,11,Fin places by the morning.              
OL,13,CSunday:FVariable cloud through the day 
OL,14,Fwith isolated light showers developing 
OL,15,Fmainly across Norfolk, but still some  
OL,16,Fbright spells expected. Temperatures   
OL,17,Fnear average and occasionally breezy   
OL,18,Fat times.                              
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
