OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FPartly
OL,6,Fcloudy with isolated showers on        
OL,7,FMonday. Cloudier through Tuesday with  
OL,8,Fstrengthening winds but mostly dry.    
OL,9,FCloudy, breezy with rain possible on   
OL,10,FWednesday. Temperatures slightly below 
OL,11,Faverage.                               
